# The build context is the repo root: `turbo prune` needs every workspace manifest and the root
# package-lock.json. Keep it small.
.git
.github
.claude
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.lighthouseci
**/out
docs
content
# apps/web is not built into this image, but turbo prune reads its manifest to resolve the workspace.
apps/web/*
!apps/web/package.json
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
